summary:
  The Last.fm entry of the cover's menu searches for whoever is on air at
  the moment it is pressed, not for the artist the menu was opened for.

history:
  A song ends while the menu is open. The menu still says the name it was
  opened with, and the listener presses the entry under that name. Bound
  to the live title, the entry would lead to the artist of the next song,
  or to nothing during an advert. The menu takes the artist when it opens
  and both entries read that copy. This mutant reads the live one.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
                  onClicked: touch.follow(MusicLinks.lastfm(touch.heldArtist))

replace:
                  onClicked: touch.follow(MusicLinks.lastfm(touch.artist))

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_the_next_song_does_not_move_an_open_menu.
  Line-neutral.
